bcmgenet_tx_reclaim_all(dev);
netif_tx_wake_all_queues(dev);
Reason:
The timeout handler incorrectly resets and wakes all TX queues even though only one queue timed out. This creates race conditions with other queues that are still operating normally, causing further network issues.

The code statements that fix the bug are:
